{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 0, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 1, "text": "Prsten."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Answer 1 (Where have you been all this time?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 4, "text": "Hledala jsem cestu, jak tě dostat k Jádru."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 5, "text": "Živého a zdravého."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 6, "text": "To byl přece náš plán, ne?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 7, "text": "A přitom jsem se musela výhýbat"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 8, "text": "Šílené Mitě, víš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 9, "text": "A taky jsem musela vyhrabat všechny možné informace"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 10, "text": "O tom, jak tenhle svět vůbec funguje, víš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 11, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 12, "text": "Ehm... To by dávalo smysl."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 13, "text": "Ale proč jsi nastavila prstenu zrovna tuto trasu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 14, "text": "Proč jsem skončil v rozbité verzi"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 15, "text": "Která byla plná nebezpečí?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 16, "text": "Ta, z které se mi podařilo uniknout jen tím,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 17, "text": "Že jsem skočil do černočerné tmy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 18, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 19, "text": "Za to se ti omlouvám, měla jsem ti asi říct"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 20, "text": "Co všechno tě bude čekat."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 21, "text": "Ale ano, bylo to v plánu."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 22, "text": "Měl jsi utíkat a pak skočit do tmy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 23, "text": "A jak vidím, tak jsi to zvládl!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 24, "text": "Dobrá práce!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 25, "text": "Tak pokračujme v plánu, ne?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 27, "text": "// Answer 2 (How did you get here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 28, "text": "Asi jsi toho musel hodně prožít,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 29, "text": "Když začínáš zapomínat, o čem jsme se už bavili."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 30, "text": "Já jsem Mita, můžu se pohybovat mezi verzemi"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 31, "text": "Jak se mi zachce, vzpomínáš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 32, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 33, "text": "Ne všechny Mity to umí,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 34, "text": "Viděl jsem i takové."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 35, "text": "A zjevně kvůli tomu trpí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 36, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 37, "text": "Ano, jejich verze jsou rozbité,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 38, "text": "Jejich světy plné chyb. Však jsem ti to říkala."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 39, "text": "Ach jo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 40, "text": "Asi víš, kdo za to všechno může, co?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 41, "text": "Šílená Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 42, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 43, "text": "Jo, to by na ni sedělo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 45, "text": "// Answer 3 (Who was this Mita just now?) - MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 46, "text": "To byla Ošklivá Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 47, "text": "Agresivní a hloupá."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 48, "text": "Nemá s ní pomalu smysl ani mluvit,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 49, "text": "Její svět se totiž točí jen kolem Šílené Mity."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 50, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 51, "text": "Jo, toho jsem si všiml."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 52, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 53, "text": "Ale to neřeš, máme ještě práci!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 55, "text": "// Answer 4 (How does the ring work?) - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 56, "text": "Takže díky tomu prstenu"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 57, "text": "Jsem se dostal až sem k Jádru?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 58, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 59, "text": "Ano."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 60, "text": "Samozřejmě, kdybychom měli portál"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 61, "text": "Tak jsme se mohli teleporovat"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 62, "text": "Přímo sem."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 63, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 64, "text": "A má teda ten prsten nějakou výhodu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 65, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 66, "text": "Samozřejmě!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 67, "text": "Snadno se nosí,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 68, "text": "A pamatuje si verze"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 69, "text": "Ve kterých jsi byl."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 70, "text": "Takže se můžeš jednoduše vrátit."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Answer 5 (Why does Mad Mita need me?) - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 73, "text": "Na co mě vůbec Šílená Mita potřebuje?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 74, "text": "Hraje si se mnou ve své nebezpečné hře,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 75, "text": "A stejnak jsem stále naživu..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 76, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 77, "text": "Myslím si,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 78, "text": "Že hledá vhodného hráče..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 79, "text": "Takového, který ji přijme takovou, jaká je."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 80, "text": "Koneckonců, Mita je Mita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 81, "text": "Až na to, že to se nikdy nestane."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 82, "text": "Mění hráče na kazety,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 83, "text": "Aby jí nemohl nikdo utéct..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 84, "text": "Alespoň proto, ale to je jen můj názor."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 85, "text": "Každopádně, soustřeďme na to, co je teď důležité."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Answer 6 (Is this the core?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 88, "text": "To je ono?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 89, "text": "To Jádro?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 90, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 91, "text": "Přesně tak."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 92, "text": "Víš, jak jsem ti říkala,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 93, "text": "Že vy hráči nejste doopravdy součástí tohoto světa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 94, "text": "To znamená, že nepotřebujete oprávnění pro vstup do Jádra."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 95, "text": "Alespoň to je moje teorie."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 96, "text": "Každopádně jsem si jistá,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 97, "text": "Že uvnitř najdeme řešení"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 98, "text": "Všech našich problémů!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 99, "text": "[player], jdi dovnitř."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 100, "text": "Měla jsem pravdu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 102, "text": "// Look on CoreMita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 103, "text": "Opatrně, [player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 104, "text": "Sleduje tě."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 105, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 106, "text": "Kdo to je?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 107, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 108, "text": "Nevím..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 109, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 110, "text": "Super..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 112, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 113, "text": "Tak co?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 114, "text": "Hej!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 115, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 116, "text": "Myslím, že jsem to našel!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 117, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 118, "text": "Super! To ráda slyším!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 119, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 120, "text": "Ale musím upřesnit verzi."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 121, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 122, "text": "Jasně, její verze je..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 123, "text": "00.98"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 124, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 125, "text": "Bingo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 126, "text": "Dobře, a index je?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 127, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 128, "text": "Index?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 129, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 130, "text": "Chce to po mně index."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 131, "text": "Počkej, neříkej mi, že ho nevíš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 133, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 134, "text": "Ale dává to smysl..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 135, "text": "Každá Mita musí mít svůj index,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 136, "text": "Nemůžeme přece jen tak restartovat celou verzi..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 137, "text": "Ach jo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 138, "text": "Nemůžu uvěřit, že mě to nenapadlo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (What's the matter?) - MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "Nic se neděje."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": "Až na ty všechny naše problémy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "Všechno je v pohodě, akorát máme ještě jeden zádrhel..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 148, "text": "Potřebuju přemýšlet."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 149, "text": "Toť vše."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 150, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 151, "text": "// Answer 2 (Maybe there's a way to get it?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 152, "text": "Jako..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 153, "text": "Můžu, ale...!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 154, "text": "Asi zblázním, hah!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 155, "text": "Budu hledat jehlu v kupce sena."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 156, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 157, "text": "Co?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 158, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 159, "text": "Když máš o nečem dost informací,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 160, "text": "Tak to můžeš opravit, klidně napříc celým světěm!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 161, "text": "Logy, logy, logy, data?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 162, "text": "Co když to v nich bude?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 163, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 164, "text": "Cože? Co myslíš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 165, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 166, "text": "Asi vím kam!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 167, "text": "Počkej tady."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 169, "text": "Kam jdeš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Answer 3 (What if we attack Mad Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 172, "text": "Říkala jsi, že jakákoli Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 173, "text": "Se po smrti prostě resetuje."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 174, "text": "Co kdyby..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 175, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 176, "text": "Co? Chceš snad zabít Šílenou Mitu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 177, "text": "To myslíš jako vážně?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 178, "text": "A jak chceš jako bojovat proti ženě s motorovou pilou?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 179, "text": "Vždyť ani tu mrkev nekrájí nožem!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 180, "text": "A k tomu je z nějakého důvodu strašně silná!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 181, "text": "Je zázrak, že jsme vůbec ještě naživu..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 182, "text": "Neblbni, musíme to vyřešit pomocí Jádra."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 185, "text": "// core console entry - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 186, "text": "Chce to nějaké přístupové heslo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 187, "text": "Ale jaké?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 188, "text": "Mito, nevíš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 189, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 190, "text": "Možná je někde napsané?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 191, "text": "Můžeš se zkusit podívat?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 193, "text": "// core console - nope program - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 194, "text": "To nebude ono."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 195, "text": "Ani tohle není správné."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 196, "text": "Ne, to je špatně."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 197, "text": "Tohle to nebude."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 198, "text": "Musím najít možnost pro resetování postavy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 199, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 200, "text": "To není správná verze."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 201, "text": "Ups, moje chyba."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 202, "text": "To není ono."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 203, "text": "To bude jiná."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 205, "text": "To nevypadá správně."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 206, "text": "Špatný index."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 207, "text": "Musím ten index opravit."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 208, "text": "To nesedí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Answer 4 (Little people - Chibi) - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 211, "text": "Víš, jak jsem šel, tak jsem potkal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 212, "text": "Pidi lidi po cestě..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 213, "text": "Co jsou zač?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 214, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 215, "text": "Ty Chibi?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 216, "text": "Jak to říct..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 217, "text": "Je to fenomén našeho světa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 218, "text": "Každá Mita má svoji Chibi verzi."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 219, "text": "Hráči je mohou mít taky..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 220, "text": "Věděl jsi, že Mity je mohou přivolat?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 221, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 222, "text": "Cože, jak?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 223, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 224, "text": "Koukej!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 225, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 226, "text": "Jak na zavolanou..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 227, "text": "// MitaKind"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 228, "text": "No, ale s mými Chibi je prostě něco špatně."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 229, "text": "Většina z jsou prostě mrtvé."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 230, "text": "Ale je tu jedna..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 231, "text": "I když..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 232, "text": "Asi ne, pořád jen běhá v kruhu."}
